    "longDescription": "<p>Beginning October 7, 2026, GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency will no longer accept TLS connections from clients that offer only X25519 for key agreement. Most customers don&#8217;t need to&#8230;</p> <p>The post <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-09-30-x25519-only-tls-ends-for-ghe-com-on-september-15\">X25519-only TLS ends for GHE.com on October 7</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://github.blog\">The GitHub Blog</a>.</p>",
